Hi Israel,

I'm not quite sure what you meant by the first sentence but, I see that all your sites are in the same NCEP pixel so that's good to know. There will be a physical reason for what you're seeing and I would advise you to compare the inputs and outputs for two sites that are extreme in the contrast you're describing to try and understand what's happening. You can check out the input data in the 'microclima.out' object returned by micro_ncep.

All the best,
Mike

