> > I can't see anything wrong with the code but I guess the problem may be to do with BURROWBHV not getting set properly, or to do with the conditions that call seldep. I use Approximatrix's Simply Fortran to debug which makes it a bit easier to see what's going on (breakpoints etc.). You could also put a write statement in the code e.g.
